mesh:bitterbal.glb @-2.22,0.12,1.95 *0.21  spin 39,44,25  path:liss:1.57,1.6,1.66,2,4,3,0.28  tint:fry  ~explode  in intro  count:3000
mesh:bitterbal.glb @-0.49,0.74,0.27 *0.16  spin 16,49,36  path:liss:0.92,1.1,1.42,4,1,3,0.43  tint:fry  ~explode  in intro  count:2500
